---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Section from '../components/Section.astro';
import Text from '../components/blocks/Text.astro';
import socialShare6a8726b0 from '../assets/images/social-share-6a8726b0.png';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | Ensure Your Privacy Today – Learn More | HelloSEO" description="Review HelloSEO's privacy policy to understand data handling and user privacy practices. Stay informed about your privacy rights with our transparent policies." ogImage={socialShare6a8726b0} headerTheme="bright">
  <Section theme="bright" divider={{ height: '6vw', stroke: 'var(--lightAccent)', strokeWidth: '8px' }} grid={{ rows: [5, 5], rowGap: 11, colGap: 11 }}>
    <Text m="3/2/5/10" d="3/10/6/18" z={1} align="center" alignM="start">
      <h1 class="ta-center"><span class="c-darkAccent">Fulfillment Policy</span></h1>
    </Text>
  </Section>

  <Section theme="white" grid={{ rows: [19, 71], rowGap: 11, colGap: 11 }} prevDivider="6vw">
    <Text m="2/2/19/10" d="3/3/64/25" z={2}>
      <h3>HelloSEO Fulfillment Policy for Credit Card Payments via Stripe®</h3>
      <p>This document outlines HelloSEO's policies for fulfilling orders and processing payments made via credit card through the Stripe payment platform.</p>
      <p><strong>Definitions</strong>The following terms apply to this Policy, as well as to any applicable Terms and Conditions, Privacy Statements, or related agreements:</p>
      <ul>
      <li>
      <p><strong>Client</strong>, <strong>You</strong>, and <strong>Your</strong> refer to the individual or entity visiting this website or engaging in services from HelloSEO in compliance with our terms and conditions, either as outlined here or in a separate written agreement.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
      <p><strong>The Company</strong>, <strong>We</strong>, <strong>Us</strong>, and <strong>Our</strong> refer to HelloSEO.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
      <p><strong>Party</strong>, <strong>Parties</strong>, or <strong>Us</strong> refers collectively to both the Client and HelloSEO.</p>
      </li>
      </ul>
      <p>All terms and language, whether singular, plural, or gender-neutral, are considered interchangeable and refer to the same.</p>
      <h3>Fulfillment Policy</h3>
      <p>At HelloSEO, customer satisfaction is our top priority. We are committed to delivering high-quality services and addressing any concerns promptly and effectively. This Fulfillment Policy outlines our approach to service delivery, refunds, and cancellations.</p>
      <h3>Delivery Policy</h3>
      <p>HelloSEO offers digital marketing and SEO consulting services. Services are delivered electronically or via telecommunication, based on the specific terms of your agreement and the scope of services requested.</p>
      <h3>Refund Policy</h3>
      <p>Refunds may be issued under the following conditions:</p>
      <ul>
      <li>
      <p>If the agreed-upon service has not been performed during the term of the contract.</p>
      </li>
      </ul>
      <p><strong>Exceptions </strong>Refunds may not be granted if:</p>
      <ul>
      <li>
      <p>The service was delivered as agreed, but you simply changed your mind.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
      <p>You were informed of any service limitations or issues prior to purchase.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
      <p>You no longer find the service useful after delivery.</p>
      </li>
      </ul>
      <p><strong>Purchase Currency</strong></p>
      <p>To support international clients, HelloSEO ensures transparency by clearly displaying the currency associated with all prices on our site. We explicitly list the currency in full (e.g., “USD - United States Dollar”) to avoid confusion, as currency symbols alone may not provide sufficient clarity. All transactions are processed in U.S. Dollars unless explicitly stated otherwise.</p>
      <h3>Security of Your Payment Information</h3>
      <p>HelloSEO prioritizes the security of our website and customer payment information.</p>
      <ul>
      <li>
      <p>We comply with PCI (Payment Card Industry) standards to ensure your payment data is handled safely. You can learn more about PCI compliance for Stripe by visiting their<a href="https://stripe.com/docs/security"><u> integration security documentation</u></a>.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
      <p>Our website and payment forms are secured with HTTPS, and we implement industry-standard security best practices to safeguard your information.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
      <p>We actively monitor and protect against potential vulnerabilities, including card testing, to ensure the integrity of our payment systems.</p>
      </li>
      </ul>
      <p>By choosing HelloSEO, you can trust that your payment information is processed securely and with the utmost care.</p>
      <h3>Return Policy</h3>
      <p>HelloSEO provides digital services, which cannot be returned. However, refunds may be issued under specific conditions as outlined above.</p>
      <h3>Cancellation Policy</h3>
      <p>HelloSEO contracts cannot be canceled during their initial duration. However, after going month-to-month, contracts may be canceled with 30-days written notice.&nbsp;</p>
      <h3>Project Abandonment</h3>
      <p>If a client becomes unresponsive or fails to participate in the service process for a period of thirty (30) days, HelloSEO may consider the project abandoned. In such cases, HelloSEO reserves the right to reduce any potential refund to zero, and the client agrees to forfeit all previously paid fees for the contracted services.</p>
      <h3>Filing a Complaint</h3>
      <p>If you are dissatisfied with our services and believe you are eligible for a refund under this Policy, please contact us at <strong>team@helloseo.com</strong> with a detailed description of your concerns. Refunds are reviewed and issued at our discretion.</p>
      <h3>Contact Us</h3>
      <p>For questions or concerns regarding this Policy, you can reach us through the following channels:</p>
      <ul>
      <li>
      <p>Email: <strong>team@helloseo.com</strong></p>
      </li>
      <li>
      <p>Website: https://helloseo.com/contact</p>
      </li>
      <li>
      <p>Mail: <strong>1501 Richland Street Columbia, SC 29201</strong></p>
      </li>
      </ul>
    </Text>
  </Section>
</Layout>
